<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n75472" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρχᾰτος</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρχος</span>
			, <i>row of trees,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλοὶ δὲ φυτῶν ἔσαν ὄρχατοι ἀμφίς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					14.123
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεπαίνοντ᾽ ὀρχάτους ὀπωρινούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					896.2
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἴνης ὀρχάτους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Moschio
				</span></i>
			 Trag.<i><span class="en">
				6.12
			</span></i> ; hence also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀδόντων ὄ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					11.374
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Maced.
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κιόνων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ach.Tat.
					5.1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> as collective
			Noun, <i>orchard, garden,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔκτοσθεν δ᾽ αὐλῆς μέγας ὄρχατος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					7.112
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				24.222
			</span></i>, al. ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄ. ἠνεμόεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					9.314
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Anyt.
			</span></i>).</div>
